This project is a pure Rust reimplementation of Android's Logical Partition
(`liblp`), Android Sparse (`libsparse`), and Dynamic Partition CLI tools
(`partition_tools`: lpmake, lpunpack, lpdump, lpadd, lpflash).

Binary formats, metadata structures, and behavioral specifications are based
on the Android Open Source Project (AOSP), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:
  - platform/system/core/fs_mgr/liblp
  - platform/system/core/libsparse
  - platform/system/extras/partition_tools
